    // Both groups are over the window: seventeen inits, all forwarded, all results read. Two result
    // columns go, the ones read last (15 and 16). The iteration argument that feeds a demoted
    // result column is preferred for the iter group and shares its local: the init of column 15
    // is stored before the loop, the before region loads it in place of the argument, the
    // condition stores only the other demoted column, the after region loads both, and the yield
    // stores the new value back into the shared local.
